    "body": "Continue https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40942 .\r\n\r\n- events\r\n- options\r\n- internal variables\r\n- ':h emacs-tags'\r\n- bulitin-function-list (https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/24493)\r\n\r\n\r\n```\r\n+vim-patch :1c00af2a2 runtime(doc): Remove obsolete labelling from 'h' occasion in :help 'highlight'\r\n+vim-patch :958ae91f3 runtime(doc): typo in recent doc style tweaks in options.txt\r\n+vim-patch :9.2.0669: GTK4: toolbar can be improved\r\n```\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nNot adding everything from `:h vim-diff`  because some should move to another section like `:h nvim-changed` to be more precise. Plan to update https://github.com/neovim/neovim/pull/40527 based on what I didn't add here. Last PR was more \"conservative\" to only introduce `xfuncname` but I missed `_` for `emacs_tags`.\r\n\r\nUnsure how to convert this strat of detecting N/A `runtime/` docs into detecting N/A options/events/variables in `src/option*` source code files.",
