            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Almost time to revisit `preprocess_patch()` to leverage (a subset?) of these strats so we don't maintain separate implementations for extracting applicable code from the vim-patch. Motivation is filtering out `runtime/` updates from applicable patches to speedup or even automate like version.c PRs.\n\nFind a way to patch, ignoring whitespace, and then re-format if needed. Since N/A hunks are eliminated, Nvim's version of those same files can eliminate the N/A sections and improve the success of the automated porting.\n\nThis shouldn't require AI (yet); just the helphelp formatter.",
