    "comment_regular_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Unsure how to convert this strat of detecting N/A `runtime/` docs into detecting N/A options/events/variables in `src/option*` source code files.\r\n\r\nCould check the commit message instead of the patch contents?\r\n\r\nAt some point, it will start to make sense to run a fast local AI model in CI to help make decisions. It doesn't need to be very smart. That would allow crafting AI prompts instead of (only) regexes. Not sure which models are small enough but capable enough to run in GHA runners.",
